{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 146,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "Praise the LORD! Praise the LORD, my soul.",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "146:1 Hebrew: יה Yah"
          },
          {
            "id": "f2",
            "text": "146:1 LORD or GOD in all caps is from the Hebrew יהוה Yahweh except when otherwise noted as being from the short form יה Yah."
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们要赞美耶和华！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們要讚美耶和華！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "While I live, I will praise the LORD. I will sing praises to my God as long as I exist.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我一生要赞美耶和华！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我一生要讚美耶和華！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "Don’t put your trust in princes, in a son of man in whom there is no help.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们不要倚靠君王，不要倚靠世人；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們不要倚靠君王，不要倚靠世人；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "His spirit departs, and he returns to the earth. In that very day, his thoughts perish.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他的气一断，就归回尘土；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他的氣一斷，就歸回塵土；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "Happy is he who has the God of Jacob for his help, hope is in the LORD, his God,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "以的 神为帮助、",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "以的上帝為幫助、",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "who made heaven and earth, the sea, and all that is in them; who keeps truth forever;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华造天、地、海，和其中的万物；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華造天、地、海，和其中的萬物；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "who executes justice for the oppressed; who gives food to the hungry. The LORD frees the prisoners.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他为受屈的伸冤，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他為受屈的伸冤，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "The LORD opens the eyes of the blind. The LORD raises up those who are bowed down. The LORD loves the righteous.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华开了瞎子的；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華開了瞎子的；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "The LORD preserves the foreigners. He upholds the fatherless and widow, but he turns the way of the wicked upside down.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华保护寄居的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華保護寄居的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "The LORD will reign forever; your God, O Zion, to all generations. Praise the LORD!",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "146:10 Hebrew: יה Yah"
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华要作王，直到永远！ 哪，你的 神要作王，直到万代！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華要作王，直到永遠！ 哪，你的上帝要作王，直到萬代！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}